<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners big buyers of S.African bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners big buyers of S.African bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 807.264 million rand worth of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				   Week to Jan 31  Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		5,803.40	  23,949.73</p>
<p>    - sales		    4,996.14	  21,751.69</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)  807.26	   2,198.04</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
